    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0938" n="833" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/pg833"/>

                <head>199. Memorandum From Lay to the NSC<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d199-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1959-09-21">September 21,
                        1959</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d199-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d199-1"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Basic National Security Policy</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REFERENCES</head>
                    <item>A. NSC 5906/1</item>
                    <item>B. NSC Action No. 2114–<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi></item>
                </list>
                <p>The enclosed draft revision of paragraph 59 (Mobilization Base) of NSC 5906/1, prepared by the NSC Planning Board on the basis of a draft
                    submitted by the Department of Defense and the Office of Civil and Defense
                    Mobilization after review of current mobilization base policy pursuant to NSC Action No. 2114–<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >c</hi>, is transmitted herewith for consideration by the National Security
                    Council at its meeting on Thursday, October 1, 1959.</p>
                <pb facs="0939" n="834" type="typeset" xml:id="pg834"/>
                <p>Also enclosed for consideration by the Council at this meeting is a draft
                    revision of paragraph 64–<hi rendition="#italic">f</hi> of NSC 5906/1, prepared by the NSC Planning Board in the light of its review of
                    the Mobilization Base paragraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">James S. Lay,
                            Jr.</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Executive Secretary</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>cc: The Secretary of the Treasury</p>
                    <p>The Attorney General</p>
                    <p>The Secretary of Commerce</p>
                    <p>The Director, Bureau of the Budget</p>
                    <p>The Chairman, Atomic Energy Commission</p>
                    <p>The Chairman, Joint Chiefs of Staff</p>
                    <p>The Director of Central Intelligence</p>
                    <p>The Chairman, Council of Economic Advisers</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d199-a1.xml" xpointer="d199-a1"/>
            </div>
